  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/P1670278.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>35 fotos de les disfreses que han recorregut la vesprada d&#39;aquest dilluns el carrer del Portal de Val&egrave;ncia, a Onda, aix&iacute; com les empinades costeres dels carrers del Temedal i Borriana, per a acabar a la cova de l&#39;Algepsar. 10 minuts abans de l&#39;hora prevista per a l&#39;inici de la desfilada, a les 19 hores, encara estava plovent intensament, pluja que havia comen&ccedil;at poc despr&eacute;s de les 16 hores.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670239.jpg\" alt=\"p1670239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670240.jpg\" alt=\"p1670240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670242.jpg\" alt=\"p1670242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670243.jpg\" alt=\"p1670243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670244.jpg\" alt=\"p1670244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670245.jpg\" alt=\"p1670245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670246.jpg\" alt=\"p1670246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestesportaldevalencia17/p1670247.jpg\" alt=\"p1670247\" style=\"max